Please strictly adhere to the following review and output rules:
Dimension assessment principle: Visual proportions in the sketch without specific dimensional annotations do not need to be considered. Speculation is strictly prohibited. All assessments must be based solely on the handwritten numerical values in the image.
Color assessment principle: The determination of the specific colors used for the storefront and signs must be based solely on the handwritten annotations in the image (bright blue, brown, lake blue) as the absolute factual basis. Completely ignore the rendered colors of the image itself.
Output content whitelist: Only output "design items that explicitly violate the attached regulations" and "items strongly not recommended according to explicit text in the attached documents". It is strictly forbidden to output any pleasantries, disclaimers, confirmations of compliant designs, or generic advice detached from the documents.
Output format restriction: You must output strictly in the following JSON format. Do not include any extra text explanations. If no violations or not-recommended items are found, output empty arrays.
{
  "violations": [
    {
      "component": "Identify the specific non-compliant component (e.g., wall-mounted signage)",
      "reason": "Quote specific clauses from the attachment and state the reason for violation",
      "required_action": "Corrective measures based on the clauses"
    }
  ],
  "not_recommended": [
    {
      "component": "Identify the specific component strongly discouraged in the document",
      "reason": "Quote specific grounds from the attachment"
    }
  ]
}

